      "required_age": 0,
      "is_free": false,
      "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461740/extras/bfdc201f1d82d7a56e213ad0224f2673.avif?t=1609459364\" width=612 height=428 /></span><br>An adventure game that decides the plot direction based on dialogue choices. Players will play an R18G painter.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >——Synopsis——</h2>The love story of a painter.<br><br>You are a small well-known Pixiv painter who likes to draw bloody paintings. Everyone alienates you. So you have always hoped that someone can understand you.<br><br>Until one day, the girl appeared...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >——Special Note——</h2>This story is adapted from the personal experience of my friends and does not involve any individual or group.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >——Game features——</h2>The game uses the first person and has an extremely immersive experience. In addition, there are three different endings, a very realistic and complex logical narrative network, and changes in the time of day and night, which are not useful but can be used as gimmick selling points.",
      "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461740/extras/bfdc201f1d82d7a56e213ad0224f2673.avif?t=1609459364\" width=612 height=428 /></span><br>An adventure game that decides the plot direction based on dialogue choices. Players will play an R18G painter.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >——Synopsis——</h2>The love story of a painter.<br><br>You are a small well-known Pixiv painter who likes to draw bloody paintings. Everyone alienates you. So you have always hoped that someone can understand you.<br><br>Until one day, the girl appeared...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >——Special Note——</h2>This story is adapted from the personal experience of my friends and does not involve any individual or group.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >——Game features——</h2>The game uses the first person and has an extremely immersive experience. In addition, there are three different endings, a very realistic and complex logical narrative network, and changes in the time of day and night, which are not useful but can be used as gimmick selling points.",
