        "notes": "The characters in this game are all over 18 years old.\r\n\r\nIn the game, the player will play a Pixiv painter, he mainly creates Guro paintings.\r\n\r\nOne day he met a Fuli Ji (a woman who sold her pornographic photos for a living on the Internet), and the story unfolded.\r\n\r\nThe game plot mainly revolves around these two professions, so there will be related plots: for example, the male protagonist (player) can choose whether to create paintings with adult themes, and will also receive commissions from various aspects; The female protagonist will update her Twitter feed from time to time (selfie with her legs, etc.) to attract more male users.\r\n\r\nIt should be noted that this is not a porn game, and the above content will only be displayed lightly."
